  "goodToKnow": "Vergiften means to poison: jemanden vergiften, das Grundwasser vergiften, and figuratively das Klima, die Atmosphäre vergiften. Die Vergiftung is poisoning: Lebensmittelvergiftung, Pilzvergiftung. Careful: das Gift means poison, not gift (das Geschenk). In an emergency, Germany has regional Giftnotrufzentralen (poison control centres). Not separable: hat vergiftet."
